  "details": "# VRChat Version:\nVRChat 2021.3.2 (Build 1121)\n# Description of the bug:\nSocial menu updates have been slow since [VRChat 2021.3.2 (2021-08-04)](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202132)\n# Steps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\n1. Prepare two accounts that are friends.\n1. Start VRChat and login with account A.\n1. Start VRChat using the profile function (`VRChat.exe --profile=1`) and login with account B\n1. Wait for the JOIN to Home to complete.\n1. In account A, open the Social menu and monitor it\n1. After about 5 minutes, you will see that account B is online",
